- Shipping costs $c_{ij}$ (from factory $i$ to distribution center $j$):

|      | B1 | B2 | B3 | B4 | B5 | B6 | B7 | B8 |
|------|----|----|----|----|----|----|----|----|
| A1   | 8  | 4  | 3  | 6  | 7  | 5  | 9  | 8  |
